listitem.para:
Adding DriverLib Support

Add the following include directory path to the project: {driverlib\mcpc029\driverlib}

Include the following header file in the project main source file:{device_support\mcpc029\common\include\driverlib.h}

Add or link the { driverlib.lib} library to the project. Location of file:{driverlib\mcpc029\driverlib\ccs\Debug}

Adding Bit-field Support

Add the following include directory path to the project: {device_support\mcpc029\headers\include}

Include the following header file in the project main source file:{device_support\mcpc029\headers\include\mcpc029_device.h}

Add or link the {mcpc029_globalvariabledefs.c} file to the project. Location of file:{device_support\mcpc029\headers\source}

Add or link the {mcpc029_Headers_nonBIOS.cmd} file to the project. Location of file:{device_support\mcpc029\headers\cmd}
